  "description": "## 5-Line Summary\n\n1. **Goal:** Replace the management dashboard's inline \"Cost & AI\" UI with the existing analytics `MetricsDashboard` component and delete the now-dead chart state.\n2. **Finding:** All four files (`ManagementDashboardView.vue`, `useManagementDashboard.js`, `MetricsDashboard.vue`, `appComponentsMap.js`) already match the intended M1 end state on disk \u2014 **no edits were required**.\n3. **Leftover (deliberate):** An inert `series` key in `defaultFilters().cost` was spotted and intentionally kept \u2014 removing it would be cosmetic churn, not a fix.\n4. **Blocker:** `npm run build` could **not** be run (no shell in that turn) \u2014 it remains the single unmet acceptance criterion, with triage steps provided if it fails.\n5. **Open decision:** M3 \u2014 pass header scope (range/project) into the embedded analytics and hide its duplicate title; plus a human needs to inspect `.codx/tasks/Maintenance/` (created tasks not persisting).",
